e, and change is what makes the world thrive.|うん、それでいいんだよ。|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|4|36|1|3|1|1|8|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|Isn\'t it thrilling to live and die for your desires? Isn\'t it better this way? Don\'t you think so?|欲望のために動いて欲望のために死んでいくなんてすっごくドキドキしない・・・？|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|3|1|1|6|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|People even kill close friends and family members just to survive every day! These difficult decisions make a drastic change to a person, and then oh, what a sight to see!|毎日生きるために仲良かった仲間や家族さえ殺しあうんだ！|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|7|4|1|6|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|If you cooperate with me, I won\'t take over your entire body. You\'ll have autonomy.|もし君が僕に協力してくれるなら君の体をすべて奪うなんてしないよ|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|11|4|1|6|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|So instead, I have a proposal.|だから...|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|3|36|1|14|4|1|6|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|You should come join me, and we\'ll become gods of the new world together. You know you want to.|僕と一緒に新しい世界の神へとなろうよ。 |1|0|1|1|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|1|4|1|10|0|0|0|Alan|アラン|It\'s true that from your perspective, this world might seem boring. But I really don\'t want such a world that\'s ridden with blood.|たしかにこの世界は君から見たらつまらないかもしれない。でも僕はやっぱしそんな世界嫌だ。 |3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|4|1|1|4|0|0|2|NULL|NULL|Huh?|は？|3|0|1|4|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|2|1|1|4|0|0|0|NULL|NULL|It\'s a world inhabited by people who harass others, right? Even your family pretends not to see the bullying you endure. So why would you want to stay?|嫌がらせをしてくるようなやつらが住んでる世界だよ？家族だって君のいじめについてみて見ぬふりしてるようなやつらだよ？なのに何で？|1|0|1|1|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|36|1|1|2|1|10|0|0|0|Alan|アラン|Even so, I can\'t abandon my family and the people of this world.|そうだとしても僕は・・・|1|0|1|1|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|26|1|1|5|1|10|0|0|0|Alan|アラン|I have a duty to fulfill, as a person who lives in this world...|家族やこの世界の人たちを見捨てられない。 |1|0|1|1|1|0|0|1|0|4|1|1|1|26|1|1|5|1|10|0|0|0|Alan|アラン|It\'s true that there are many people who do terrible things, but I also know that there are plenty of good people as well.|確かにひどいことをしてくる人はいっぱいいるけど・・